atus="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NIPPON SIGNAL CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI MASARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI SHINICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIMURA, KANJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, MASARU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, SHINICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>THE NIPPON SIGNAL CO., LTD</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIMURA KANJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI MASARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI SHINICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIMURA, KANJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, MASARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, SHINICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>This invention provides an inexpensive, thin display card that can rewrite display information without the aid of an external writing device. The card is composed of a data processing section and a display processing section provided with a heating part and heat-sensitive parts. The heating part includes a plurality of heating elements, of which those selected by a selector circuit depending on the data stored in memory generate heat. In response to the thermal energy, the state of the corresponding portions of the heat-sensitive part changes to display information corresponding to the stored data. Therefore, the card rewrites display information automatically by itself.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une carte d'affichage mince et peu coûteuse capable de réécrire une information affichée sans l'aide d'un dispositif d'écriture externe. Cette carte est composée d'une section de traitement de données et d'une section de traitement d'affichage comprenant une partie chauffante et des parties thermosensibles. La partie chauffante comprend une pluralité d'éléments chauffants. Les éléments chauffants sélectionnés par un circuit sélecteur en fonction des données en mémoire génèrent de la chaleur. En réponse à l'énergie thermique, l'état des portions correspondantes de la partie thermosensible est modifié de sorte que ces portions affichent les informations correspondant aux données mémorisées. Cette carte peut ainsi réécrire automatiquement et indépendamment les informations affichées.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>